sequenceDiagram
    actor Caller
    participant CLI as Run preparation
    participant Control as Control PostgreSQL
    participant Objects as Storage adapter
    Caller->>CLI: run create with finalized dataset and prepare-only
    CLI->>Control: Verify catalog, freeze evaluator artifacts and placements
    CLI->>Control: Persist creating run, claim creation lease and generation
    loop Verified dataset batches, bounded index traversal
        CLI->>Objects: Read and verify index or batch
        CLI->>CLI: Validate routing, fold identities, chunks and gate counts
        opt Complete bounded chunk page
            CLI->>Control: Record exact file ownership under live lease
            CLI->>Objects: Create or reconcile immutable file
            CLI->>Control: Acknowledge contiguous chunk progress
        end
    end
    CLI->>CLI: Verify complete dataset identity and coverage
    CLI->>Objects: Publish verified indexes, gates, configuration and manifest
    Note over CLI,Control: Every file is owned before PUT and acknowledged afterward
    CLI->>Control: Atomically seal ready plan and compact shard metadata
    Control-->>CLI: Root reference, run remains creating
    CLI-->>Caller: Plan ready, dispatchable false
